<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Live basis - compared with Wednesday's close, USDA said. Steers and heifers were not tested in a slow trade.</p>
<p>On a carcass basis - steers were not well tested, with heifers not tested. Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs ld 111.00.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Thursday: 100  Week to Date: 35,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
